  "projectType": "infrastructure",
  "projectName": "Synapse Terraform Providers",
  "projectDescription": "A suite of Terraform providers for securely accessing GCP resources through Identity-Aware Proxy (IAP) tunnels, enabling Helm and Kubernetes deployments without exposing infrastructure to the public internet.",
